1
00:00:03,337 --> 00:00:06,577
(Sheldon:)Gentlemen, Star Wars Day
is rapidly approaching.

2
00:00:06,740 --> 00:00:08,410
(Sheldon:)We should finalize our plans.

3
00:00:08,575 --> 00:00:10,575
(Penny:)What? That's a real thing?

4
00:00:11,512 --> 00:00:13,722
(Penny:)What is it, Star Wars Christmas?

5
00:00:13,881 --> 00:00:16,261
(Howard:)No. Don't be ridiculous.

6
00:00:16,416 --> 00:00:18,326
That's Wookie Life Day.

7
00:00:19,820 --> 00:00:20,820
(Penny:)So when is it?

8
00:00:20,988 --> 00:00:23,488
Well, lt's not May the fifth,

9
00:00:23,657 --> 00:00:26,107
(Leonard:)and it's not May the third...

10
00:00:30,430 --> 00:00:32,930
(Leonard:)It's May the fourth.

11
00:00:34,501 --> 00:00:35,841
(Sheldon:)Get it?

12
00:00:36,570 --> 00:00:39,570
May the "fourth" be with you'?

13
00:00:40,541 --> 00:00:42,711
"May the force be with you."
Get it?

14
00:00:42,876 --> 00:00:45,286
Oh, nu, this face
wasn't because I didn't get it.

15
00:00:46,947 --> 00:00:48,617
I (THEME SONG PLAYS)

